	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050020"},
		line=1202,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Autumn in Iseya comes and goes with the wind.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Once full of warmth, it now carries the chill of the coming winter as it brushes past my hands on the wheelchair.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Look how pretty the leaves are, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"It's been four months since the Sworn Blades' failed uprising.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Right when it seemed we were on the brink of successfully liberating the Imperial Palace, our forces were ambushed and routed by Rochel.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The three of us barely managed to escape with our lives to the secluded forests of Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I heard that the leaves only get this red if there's big changes in temperature.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Soujin, still sitting in his wheelchair, remains silent.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Kotone and the remaining priestesses were able to bring him back from the brink of death.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"All his injuries have been healed. His injuries have been healed, yet─",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"He silently wakes in the mornings and mutely falls asleep at night.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"He obediently swallows all the food I bring to his mouth.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"...And he never once responds no matter how many times I whisper his name.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Kotone says that his soul may be wandering due to having spent such a long time on the brink of life and death.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Several priestesses arrived to Heal him today as well, but as always, there is no sign of any progress.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Say, do you like persimmons?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"We're surrounded by persimmon trees, their branches laden with ripe fruits.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Seeing them, I'm reminded of when I first met Kotone here in Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When I was little, I didn't really think much of them one way or another.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But now, I can't get enough of 'em.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"One of the most vivid memories I still have of that time is how sweet and tender those persimmons were.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"In a way, they're just like Kotone herself.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey... Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"I look around and find nobody in sight.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"That means I'm allowed to say what's really on my mind... right?",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When I heard you'd pull through, I could barely stop myself from crying.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I thought it was enough just that you were alive, even if you never woke up again.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But... I really do miss you...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"No, not in the way that a lord might miss the presence of a capable servant.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"To me, you were always so much more than a loyal vassal or a dear friend.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"You're someone so much more precious, so much more irreplaceable...",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even an insensitive simpleton like you wouldn't just leave me like this, would you?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please, Soujin... I don't know if I can go on without you...”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"My breath chokes in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I know I promised that I wouldn't cry in front of you ever again, but─",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"All the same, a single, tiny petal comes fluttering down.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"It drifts on the wind before gently landing on the back of\nSoujin's hand.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Perhaps it's his reaction to my moment of weakness, or perhaps it's nothing more than a hallucination born from my own wishful thinking...",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"But I feel like just now, I saw Soujin's hand move ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Across the ephemeral haze of a distant spring, Himi-no-Mikoto graces me with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...? I thought you had passed on.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"In reply, she merely lets slip a sorrowful smile.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I guess I shouldn't worry about the details.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm just glad you're all right. C'mon, let's go back.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I offer her an outstretched hand, but she makes no move to grasp it.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Just how much longer do you intend to slumber, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I thought I'd created you to be a little doughtier than this.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto peers at me, her eyes crinkling at the edges.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"A single peach petal drifts in on the spring breeze.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Ever so gently, it flutters down─",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Alighting on mine open palm and soothing mine aching heart.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I awaken in a dark room.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Ahh, so it was just a dream...",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I raise and examine the hand I had been holding out just a few moments ago.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Naturally, there is no trace of any peach petal.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Of course. Himi-no-Mikoto is dead.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I ought to have given everything to protect her─",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"But instead, I allowed her to be stolen away from me...",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You were making a lot of noise. Is everything okay?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"A certain girl barges into the room and locks eyes with me.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The two of us silently stare at each other, her round eyes growing wider by the second.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no... Mikoto...?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“H-He talked!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Huh? N-No freaking way! Is this for real?!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"She hastily scurries over and kneels down next to me.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, thank Oomikami! You're finally awake!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...? You're alive?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What are you saying? How am I supposed to be the Founding Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, whatever. I'm just so glad you're finally awake!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Does it hurt anywhere? Do you have an appetite?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Where... am I?",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"And who is this before me?",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I force myself to calm down and take in the surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Ah, I remember now...",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I murmur slowly, as though carefully checking the sound of each syllable.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's right. It's me, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like you kept your memories this time. Oh, thank goodness.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, what might be the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Another girl timidly pokes her head into the room.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Is that you, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hweeeh?! How can this be?! Is this really happening?! Awawawahhhh...”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Kotone starts rapidly spinning around on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"It's almost as though she's just witnessed a corpse come back from the dead.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Wait a minute.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why was I sleeping?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You don't remember?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Republican Army ambushed us during our uprising.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And you risked your life to get us out of Tenkyo...”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"As I listen to Akari's explanation, my memories slowly start coming back to me.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"In mid-August, those of us in the Sworn Blades rallied our forces and stormed the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Following that, we were caught in an ambush laid by Rochel, forcing the three of us to flee to the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's right, I...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Guh...!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I try to pick myself up, but my body refuses to obey.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't push yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Akari lays a hand on my shoulder through the futon.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When we got to Iseya, you were in really bad shape.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone Healed you as best as she could, but you still\nwouldn't wake up.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your soul had departed from your body.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You were alive in the broadest sense, but you never so much as responded no matter what we said to you.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So that's how it was...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"I peer out the window and spot an eyeful of bright red foliage.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The leaves have turned red.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's autumn now.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've been asleep for nearly four months.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"...Four months?",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"It takes some time for me to find my words again.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I must have caused you a great deal of trouble.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Certainly not, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Just knowing that you are all right, I-I...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C'mon now. No need for that.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Akari reaches over and gently rubs the sniffling Kotone's back.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"All the while, wearing a terribly lonely expression of her own.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, Kotone came here to Heal you every single day.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She'd get here before everyone else, and wouldn't leave until it was already dark out.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure it's all thanks to her that you're better now.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You shouldn't have, Kotone. But thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Still unable to get up, the most I can do is lower my head in her direction.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"If only I could move my body the way I want to.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You sustained such terrible injuries in the course of protecting us.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is only right that I should repay this tremendous debt of gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Besides, I was not the only person who saw to your care.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama was always there by your bedside, attending to your every need.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She would check on you at the top of every hour, feeding you your meals and changing your clothes.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-It's nothing, really, just the least I could do...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Plus, I also owe you for saving me.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Akari bashfully averts her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your Healing, too, was not anything I could have done alone. Every last priestess in Iseya devoted the full measure of their power.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Iseya?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is correct. We are currently in Inner Iseya, a hallowed sanctum found deep in the mountains of Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've never even heard of this place.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is a very secure location free from danger, so you may rest easy.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“I heard a disturbance. Is everything quite all right?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"A clear voice rings out from outside.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Moments later, a priestess I've never seen before pokes her head into the room.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Isuzu, Soujin-sama has awoken!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Oh my, that is quite the extraordinary development.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Despite her words, however, the priestess unhurriedly glides into the room before kneeling down next to me with refined, graceful movements.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It is my pleasure to make your acquaintance, sir. Shizukura Isuzu, the superintendent of Iseya, is humbly at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"She graciously lowers her head to the floor.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"As she lifts her head once more, the gesture fills the room with a faintly elegant fragrance.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shizukura-dono, then.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin. Warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Please, do just call me Isuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It simply would not do for you to address the Exalt-Priestess so intimately while addressing her inferiors in such a respectful manner.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Isuzu replies, cracking an easy smile.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The superintendent is responsible for overseeing the priesthood here in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The Exalt-Priestess's duties often require her to remain in Tenkyo, so the entire Iseyan priesthood is effectively administered by the superintendent.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Every last member of our order is sure to be most familiar with Isuzu's name.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“That's me, the Exalt-Priestess's errand girl.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“C-Certainly not! That is hardly fair!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The only reason I can afford to be so lackadaisical is because Isuzu always takes care of all the work.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Indeed, my work is never done.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why must you always be so terribly unfair...?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Kotone is on the verge of tears, while Isuzu is still flashing a composed grin.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"From this exchange alone, it's evident that they're very close with each other.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It seems the priestesses of Iseya have gone to great lengths to care for me. You have my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It's an honor to have merely been of service to you, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Moreover, it was the Exalt-Priestess herself who did more than anyone else.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“If you would be so kind, I do believe she deserves particular praise for her devotion.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-Isuzu, that's enough...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Oh dear, did I perhaps say too much?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“In any case, please do not hesitate to call upon me if you require anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"With one final bow, Isuzu withdraws from the room.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please pay her no mind, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There are few things Isuzu enjoys more in this world than picking on me.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha... That said, I am very grateful to you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It must have taken a lot out of you to come and Heal me every day.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You have nothing to worry about, sir. As you can see, I am still as fit as a fiddle.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're not fooling anyone. You've hardly eaten anything these past few days.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin's awake now, so focus on taking care of your own health.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah... R-Right...”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Now that I look closely, Kotone's cheeks are noticeably more hollow than I remember.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"She must have pushed herself quite a bit.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"I owe it to her to repay her kindness someday.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't worry about anything else for now, Soujin. You should focus on getting some rest.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It doesn't have to be long, but could you at least tell me what happened in Tenkyo? I wouldn't be able to sleep in peace otherwise.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All right, I suppose that's fair.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Akari reaches over and turns on the television in the corner of the room.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"The television flickers on, displaying a news program with the Imperial Palace in view behind the reporter.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like I mentioned earlier, it's already been four months since we arrived here in Inner Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You, me, and Kotone were the only ones that made it here from Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We've heard news about Kanami, Elsa, and Shino, though.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami's being confined to the Imperial Palace, Shino's gone into hiding somewhere in Tenkyo, and Elsa... well, she didn't take long to turn things around.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides that, we know that all the warriors, Inou included, were arrested, but we haven't heard anything about what happened to them afterwards.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The manager drove us to the Imperial Temple, but after he left, we don't know what happened to him, either.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"What a dismal state of affairs.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I'm overwhelmed with regret and guilt at the fact I managed to get out safely while all my comrades were arrested.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"I can only hope that they're still alive...",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Republican Army seized control of Tenkyo immediately afterwards and declared martial law.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There are arrest warrants out for all priestesses and warriors, so we haven't been able to get into contact with anyone.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, this is the only source of information about Tenkyo we have.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Akari directs a pointed look at the television.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Newscaster"},
			{
"“A victory ceremony was held in Tenkyo this afternoon.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Newscaster"},
			{
"“Lieutenant General Elsa was officially commended for her instrumental role in suppressing the warrior insurrection earlier this summer.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Newscaster"},
			{
"“The Lieutenant General has been appointed vice governor-general and will be working closely alongside Empress Hisui for the betterment of our Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"On the screen, Warren and Elsa are shaking hands with wide smiles for the cameras.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wasn't Elsa on our side? Why is she the vice governor-general now?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like I said, she really turned things around for herself.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Going from major to lieutenant general is certainly quite the promotion.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Elsa steps away from Warren and immediately begins to address the assembled reporters.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The warriors' insurrection has left deep scars on the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The chancellor was a man devoted to the good of the Empire, and his death is a great loss for this country.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republic will do everything in its power to carry on his legacy and continue to support Empress Hisui for the betterment of this Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
{"font", size=47},
"“Our paramount priority moving forward will be the establishment of a just and democratic political order, where each and every citizen will be able to participate as equals in their own governance.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But before that can be made a reality, the disruptive political violence perpetrated by terrorists must be put to a stop by any means necessary.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
{"font", size=53},
"“At present, we are sparing no effort to capture the\ninsurrection's ringleader, Miyaguni Akari; her co-conspirator, Tokita Soujin; and the Exalt-Priestess, Shiinoha Kotone.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyone who has information that may lead to their arrest is strongly encouraged to call the Government-General tipline at any time.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Through the screen, Elsa shows us a perfect smile, overflowing with pure malice.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that didn't make it obvious, the three of us are all wanted criminals now.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"She flicks off the television in annoyance.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In other words, Elsa betrayed us?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I didn't want to believe it... but that sure is what it looks like.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"If Elsa's goal was to dismantle the Sworn Blades and rise to a position where she can shape the Empire to her will─",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Then we fell right into her trap.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't want to believe it until I hear it from her own mouth.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah. I've got a few words for her myself.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Akari and I share a knowing nod with each other.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, how did we manage to get to Iseya?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I transported us here with magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You could perhaps think of us as having traversed a tunnel which instantaneously moves us from the Imperial Palace to Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The priestesses and I prepared it before the uprising in the event of an emergency.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And thanks to her preparations, we managed to make it here in no time at all.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's yet another debt of gratitude I owe you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You were very wise to prepare for such an eventuality.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, it was nothing at all! Ehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Kotone denies it, even as she puffs out her chest.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though, won't the Republican Army be able to pursue us to Iseya in the same way?”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The portal has already been closed, so there is nothing to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“On top of that, Inner Iseya is enclosed by spellwards that render it invisible from the outside.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even if the Republican Army comes looking for us here, they will not be able to find us easily.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And on top of ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that,",
{"/font"},
" even if we were to be attacked, there are all manners of Artifacts enshrined here which we can use in our defense.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like a real fortress.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
{"font", size=53},
"“Precisely! Inner Iseya was built from the very start to serve as an impenetrable keep, secured by magicks, where the Imperial Family might turn to for refuge in times of peril!”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Kotone goes on to give me an overview of Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Iseya is known all throughout the Empire as the holiest of all cities, being the birthplace of the Imperial faith and the site of the Great Temple.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"A full day's walk from Iseya proper, Inner Iseya is situated in a narrow valley, flanked by steep mountain peaks on both east and west.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"It is a small settlement comprising twenty-some small temples, the foremost among them being the Chancel Shrine located at the very rear.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Close to 150 priests and 200 priestesses are stationed here year-round, carrying out the rites and upkeep of the various temples present.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"But Inner Iseya's primary purpose has always been to function as the final bastion of the Empire in the event of a crisis that would threaten its very survival.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"The entire area is enwreathed in layers upon layers of protective magicks, such that unauthorized persons would be unable to even perceive the existence of the settlement.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Furthermore, various strongpoints throughout the valley are equipped with powerful Artifacts capable of resisting any invaders.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Apparently, the room that we're currently in is part of the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's the first time I've heard any of this.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even within the priesthood, the existence of Inner Iseya is a closely guarded secret.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is strictly forbidden to leave any records of it, and it would not be found on any maps, either.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, nobody's come for us even after all this time, so maybe these spellwards you mentioned really do work?”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You would doubt their power?”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well... y'know? You can't really see magicks with your eyes, so doesn't it make you a bit nervous to rely on them for protection?”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, magicks are a miracle bestowed upon us by Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Doubting them would be to doubt Oomikami Himself.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"Kotone wags her finger in admonishment.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I get it. I'm sorry for having my doubts.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Akari turns to look at me.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyways, Soujin, you should just focus on resting.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your number one priority should be to start recovering your strength.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whatever the case, if I can't even hold my blade, I won't be able to fulfill my duty as a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Exactly.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"She pats me on the chest through the futon.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-sama, would you care to take a meal, perhaps?”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Isuzu returns, carrying a tray laden with stewed mountain vegetables, simmered mushrooms, and fresh tofu.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Given our location, we are required to live off of nature's bounty, but if such victuals are not to your appetite...”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, no, a meal like this is more than enough for me.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Besides, tofu is my favorite food. I couldn't imagine anything better.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"My stomach lets out an involuntary growl at the pleasant aroma of freshly-made tofu.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"It serves as a stark reminder that it's been a terribly long time since I was able to do anything as simple as eating a meal of my own volition.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
